MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This issue has no effect on EFA models as these are estimated with orthogonal latent trait configurations. So, unless you have a confirmatory IRT model with estimated covariance terms you won't see any change in your exploratory models. HTH.

Phil

